{"blocks":[["Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Time/Abstraction/","source-block-1783","What does your reason tell you about the area? ⚑",["See also Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Roadmap/Adjustment/Area - Area review","Quotes","ask the following questions with sincerity; it doesn't matter if answers aren't forthcoming; \"live the questions.\""]],["Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Time/Abstraction/","source-block-1954","Where are you currently pursuing comfort, when what's called for is a little discomfort? ⚑",["See also Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Roadmap/Adjustment/Area - Area review","Quotes","ask the following questions with sincerity; it doesn't matter if answers aren't forthcoming; \"live the questions.\""]],["Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Time/Abstraction/","source-block-2207","In what ways have you yet to accept the fact that you are who you are, not the person you think you ought to be? ⚑",["See also Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Roadmap/Adjustment/Area - Area review","Quotes","ask the following questions with sincerity; it doesn't matter if answers aren't forthcoming; \"live the questions.\""]],["Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Time/Abstraction/","source-block-2509","Where are you holding back until you feel like you know what you’re doing? ⚑",["See also Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Roadmap/Adjustment/Area - Area review","Quotes","ask the following questions with sincerity; it doesn't matter if answers aren't forthcoming; \"live the questions.\""]],["Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Time/Abstraction/","source-block-2737","How would you spend your time differently in the area if you didn’t care so much about seeing your actions reach fruition? ⚑",["See also Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Roadmap/Adjustment/Area - Area review","Quotes","ask the following questions with sincerity; it doesn't matter if answers aren't forthcoming; \"live the questions.\""]],["Person/Lyz/Garden/Navigation/Life/Time/Abstraction/","source-block-3069","P